      <description>Hubble 1.5.2

Hubble 1.5.2: Reliable module connection switches

Fixes module connections getting stuck on or off after toggling them.

- Keeps your latest enable/disable choice when saves finish.
- Prevents older saves from making switches flip back on their own.
- Keeps switches responsive for connected and disconnected modules, including DIT Browse and LiveGrade.</description>
